#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-control-zero-F7.rst:60
#: 23227a1f02654eb7bf4ed602274e5254
msgid "Dshot capability"
msgstr "DShot 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mro-control-zero-F7.rst:62
#: 90f022138934480881191b39b04418f2
msgid ""
"All motor/servo outputs are Dshot and PWM capable. However, mixing Dshot and"
" normal PWM operation for outputs is restricted into groups, ie. enabling "
"Dshot for an output in a group requires that ALL outputs in that group be "
"configured and used as Dshot, rather than PWM outputs. The output groups "
"that must be the same (PWM rate or Dshot, when configured as a normal "
"servo/motor output) are: 1-4, 5/6, and 7/8."
msgstr ""
"所有电机/舵机输出均支持 DShot 和 PWM。但是，在同一组输出中混用 DShot 和普通 PWM 操作是受限制的，即为某组内某个输出启用 "
"DShot 时，该组内所有输出都必须配置并用作 DShot，而非 PWM 输出。必须保持相同（PWM 速率或 "
"DShot，当配置为普通舵机/电机输出时）的输出组为：1-4、5/6 和 7/8。"

